@startuml SignalForge_Sequence_Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title SignalForge End-to-End Flow Sequence

actor "Security\nOperator" as Operator
participant "UI\n(SvelteKit)" as UI
participant "API\n(FastAPI)" as API
box "Ingest Pipeline" #F5F5F5
    participant "Collector\n(Go)" as Collector
    participant "Redis\nStreams" as Redis
    participant "Detector\n(Python)" as Detector
end box
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
entity "Network" as Network

== Data Ingestion ==

Network -> Collector: 1. Raw packet headers
activate Collector
Collector -> Collector: Parse & aggregate flows
Collector -> Redis: 2. Publish FlowEnded event
deactivate Collector

Redis -> Detector: 3. Consume flow summary
activate Detector
Detector -> Detector: Baseline learning\nAnomaly detection
Detector -> DB: 4. Store flows, alerts,\nbaselines, entities
deactivate Detector

== Real-time Alerting ==

DB -> API: 5. New alert trigger
activate API
API -> UI: 6. SSE push alert
deactivate API
UI -> Operator: 7. Display notification

== Operator Query ==

Operator -> UI: 8. Request flows/alerts
activate UI
UI -> API: 9. REST GET request
activate API
API -> DB: 10. SQL query
activate DB
DB --> API: 11. Result set
deactivate DB
API --> UI: 12. JSON response
deactivate API
UI -> UI: Render table/charts
UI --> Operator: 13. Display data
deactivate UI

== Alert Acknowledgment ==

Operator -> UI: 14. Acknowledge alert
activate UI
UI -> API: 15. PUT /alerts/{id}
activate API
API -> DB: 16. UPDATE alert status
activate DB
DB --> API: 17. Confirmation
deactivate DB
API --> UI: 18. Success response
deactivate API
UI --> Operator: 19. Update UI
deactivate UI

@enduml
